{"title": "Cambridge Professor Jason Arday Found Dead Amid Plagiarism Scrutiny", "summary": "Dr. Jason Arday, the youngest Black professor at Cambridge University, was found dead at age 41. His death occurred amidst scrutiny over his academic credentials and accusations of plagiarism. The Good Law Project stated on its website that Arday's death was a \"direct, foreseeable and foreseen result of press harassment.\" UK political figures have called for reflection following the incident. A funeral fundraiser for Arday had raised over £65,000.", "summary_points": ["Dr. Jason Arday, Cambridge University's youngest Black professor, died at 41.", "His death followed scrutiny and accusations of plagiarism regarding his academic credentials.", "The Good Law Project attributed his death to \"press harassment.\"", "UK political figures have called for reflection on the matter.", "A funeral fundraiser for Arday exceeded £65,000."], "title_hi": "कैम्ब्रिज के प्रोफेसर जेसन अर्डे साहित्यिक चोरी की जांच के बीच मृत पाए गए", "summary_hi": "कैम्ब्रिज विश्वविद्यालय के सबसे कम उम्र के अश्वेत प्रोफेसर डॉ. जेसन अर्डे का 41 वर्ष की आयु में निधन हो गया। उनकी मृत्यु उनके शैक्षणिक प्रमाण पत्रों पर जांच और साहित्यिक चोरी के आरोपों के बीच हुई। गुड लॉ प्रोजेक्ट ने अपनी वेबसाइट पर कहा कि अर्डे की मृत्यु \"प्रेस उत्पीड़न का सीधा, अनुमानित और अपेक्षित परिणाम\" थी। इस घटना के बाद यूके के राजनीतिक हस्तियों ने चिंतन के लिए आह्वान किया है। अर्डे के लिए एक अंतिम संस्कार धन उगाहने वाले अभियान ने £65,000 से अधिक जुटाए थे।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Frames the death as a direct result of \"press harassment\" and \"hounding\" by the media.", "Highlights the Good Law Project's statement attributing the death to media actions."], "center": ["Focuses on the scrutiny of Arday's credentials and plagiarism accusations.", "Mentions the UK leader's call for reflection following the death."], "right": ["Leads with the fact of Arday's death and his position as Cambridge's youngest-ever Black professor.", "Highlights the plagiarism scandal as a key element of the story."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["मृत्यु को \"प्रेस उत्पीड़न\" और मीडिया द्वारा \"परेशान करने\" का सीधा परिणाम बताया गया है।", "गुड लॉ प्रोजेक्ट के बयान को उजागर किया गया है जिसमें मृत्यु का श्रेय मीडिया की कार्रवाइयों को दिया गया है।"], "center": ["अर्डे की साख की जांच और साहित्यिक चोरी के आरोपों पर केंद्रित है।", "मृत्यु के बाद यूके के नेता के चिंतन के आह्वान का उल्लेख किया गया है।"], "right": ["अर्डे की मृत्यु और कैम्ब्रिज के सबसे कम उम्र के अश्वेत प्रोफेसर के रूप में उनकी स्थिति के तथ्य से शुरुआत की गई है।", "कहानी के एक प्रमुख तत्व के रूप में साहित्यिक चोरी कांड को उजागर किया गया है।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/shutterstock-editorial-13789597b.jpg?c=16x9&q=w_800,c_fill", "sources": [{"source": "The Washington Post", "owner": "The Washington Post", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Youngest Black professor at Cambridge, who faced plagiarism claims, is found dead"}, {"source": "Politico", "owner": "Politico", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "British leader calls for reflection after death of former Cambridge professor accused of plagiarism"}, {"source": "The Globe and Mail", "owner": "The Globe and Mail", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQM2NZT1ZsTVdUa0R4YkdPQ0tsOGJLd0dtRjdmTk9URGxYRktYeXl0UnBuMzY4YmJlZXBGS0szMDV0VktrWDRrVTdkSnRGYmVSd3BEN1RKSURoLVNWdzRSekhna01vVUUxSDFqSjQ5YkRhdjI1bXNKOVliMkw1NXhwLUJwV01RY0RpSDJFTFZMbHNFOFplcTZJdF9aQld6a1pzdVdNQVFIc08tLWd0aW9oNHN3?oc=5", "headline": "Video: UK's leader calls for reflection after the death of former Cambridge professor accused of plagiarism"}, {"source": "Australian Financial Review", "owner": "Australian Financial Review", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.g